<lb n="15"/>dieselbige <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">züerfordern</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">züerheben</unclear>. Und
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruf</unclear> nit ermanglen wollen, E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. F. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züersüchen</unclear>, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wollen</unclear> besag-
