<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1779_6569.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="38"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> willig dienst, unnd was wir
<lb n="39"/>ehren liebs unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegenn</unclear>, zuvor, hochge-
<lb n="40"/>acht, edel, vest, fürsichtig, ersam, weis, sonder
<lb n="41"/>liebe herren, unnd guete freündt.
<lb n="42"/>Demnach dieselben, unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemainer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">un</unclear>-
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">serer</unclear> statt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bey</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hundert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jaehrern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschreibung</unclear>
